  "editorial": {
    "name": "AgnosUI",
    "descriptionZh": "AgnosUI 是一套框架无关的组件工厂，同一份 TypeScript 工厂同时给 Angular、React、Svelte 生成无样式组件，另外单发一份 Bootstrap 皮肤。版权方是 Amadeus，整库 MIT。",
    "takeawayZh": "拿 headless 工厂同时喂三个前端框架",
    "noteZh": "首屏大标题 AgnosUI Where components shine.，小标题 Perfected component libraries，三条带箭头的小字写 Typescript factories、Headless wrappers、Bootstrap-styled ready-to-use。再往下是 Get started with 三个圆形按钮 React、Svelte、Angular，接着浅紫卡片依次是 Framework agnostic、Headless components、Consistent、Accessible、Highly configurable、Fully tested、Bootstrap components、SSR compliant。Fully tested 一段点名 Unit tests 用 Vitest、E2e tests with Playwright（含 SSR hydration 测试）、libs 集成测试走 Verdaccio。页脚写 Released under the MIT License. Copyright © 2023 - present Amadeus，顶部导航是 Documentation、API、Blog，右侧标 v0.11.0。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free（页脚写 Released under the MIT License）",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
